description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-06-25T17:33:08Z","updated_at":"2025-06-27T18:00:24Z","closed_at":"2025-06-27T17:43:02Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in upstream master branch\nI think it wasn't reproducible when I started working on my SDL3 PR ( https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106218 )\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta (52528fc22) - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon(TM) Graphics (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 31.0.12018.5) - AMD Ryzen 5 5500U with Radeon Graphics (12 threads) - 7.33 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nRecently Godot started to rebuild the whole project mostly every time SCons build system is called when using Windows + MSVC (Visual Studio). I don't think it happened around a month ago when I started to work on my SDL3 PR, but today I noticed it and Calinou confirmed the issue in Rocket Chat.\nI'm not sure if it's a small problem in Godot's Windows build system or if it's a MSVC problem though.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Use Windows and MSVC for Godot source code compilation\n2. Get Godot source code\n3. Compile it the first time\n4. ~~Either try to recompile it immediately or wait for some time and then recompile~~ Change a code inside some header file (I added a space in \"core/input/input.h\" file and I think it caused the whole project to recompile because I saw that subfolders in \"modules\" folder unrelated to input started to recompile)\n5. Notice that sometimes it rebuilds the whole project instead of only rebuilding the changed files/not rebuilding anything at all if nothing has been changed\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107983/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107983/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}